\code{survey_nonprob}, not a \code{survey_replicate}, because DAGJK replicate weights
are NPS pseudo-weights that must remain associated with the IPW weighting
pipeline. This is consistent with
\code{create_bootstrap_weights(type = "quasi-randomization")}. The
\verb{@variables$type} field is set to \code{"group-jackknife"}, a surveywts-specific
value. Downstream \code{survey}-package functions expecting a standard type
